# Inbox & Meetings

When adding or syncing meeting notes:

- **Inbox is flat:** `00_Inbox/Meetings/` has no subfolders. Unrouted meetings (last 5 days) land here. Routing: **`99_System/meetings/routing.json`** (see **`Meetings/meeting-sync.mdc`**).
  - **1:1 with direct** → `05_Areas/People/Team/{Name}/`
  - **Leader + customer/account** → stays in Inbox
  - **Other leader meetings** → `05_Areas/People/Leaders/{folder}/`
  - **Product team** (title keywords) → `05_Areas/Product Team/Meetings/`
- **Ideas** → `00_Inbox/Ideas/`
- **5-day rule:** Older Inbox meetings → `90_Archives/Meetings/`
- **Consumed** notes move to a person/project folder or archive
- **Extracted actions** → `01_Tasks/Tasks.md`
